flowchart TD
    Request[Interview API request] --> Action{action}
    Action -->|start| InterviewNode[Interview graph node]
    InterviewNode --> InterviewAgent[Interview agent]
    InterviewAgent --> LLM[Groq chat model]
    LLM --> Questions[Question JSON]
    Action -->|feedback| FeedbackNode[Feedback graph node]
    FeedbackNode --> FeedbackAgent[Feedback agent]
    FeedbackAgent --> LLM
    LLM --> Complete{completed?}
    Complete -->|No| ReturnFeedback[Return feedback]
    Complete -->|Yes| SummaryNode[Summary graph node]
    SummaryNode --> SummaryAgent[Summary agent]
    SummaryAgent --> LLM
    LLM --> Report[Report JSON]
    Questions --> Mongo[(MongoDB interview)]
    Report --> Mongo
    Roadmap[Roadmap workflow] --> RoadmapAgent[Roadmap agent] --> ResourceAgent[Resource agent]
    ResourceAgent --> YouTube[YouTube API]
